# Docker matches these against the full path and does not recurse implicitly, so
# every pattern needs **/ or it only ever excludes the copy at the repo root.
#
# The tsbuildinfo files matter as much as dist: `tsc -b` is incremental and trusts
# them, so a stale one from the host makes it skip emitting entirely. Shipping
# those without their dist output produced a build that resolved workspace imports
# only because the host's dist happened to be in the context.
**/node_modules
**/.git
**/.next
**/.turbo
**/dist
**/*.tsbuildinfo
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example
